  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.5 - fix: changing GgufBatchDecoder.Lora in place now drops recorded decode steps (CUDA graphs and WebGPU plans kept replaying the old adapter set); a Q6_K vector decode GEMV (Q4_K_M models: qwen3:1.7b CUDA decode 181 -> 190 tok/s). Since 5.8.4: GGUF decode about 2x faster on CUDA for Q8_0 (80 -> 165 tok/s on an RTX 4070), Q8_0 prefill on tensor cores, a per-run output leak fixed in 23 pipelines, ObjectDetectionPipeline at any input size with opt-in EnableGraphCapture. Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
